    "text": "By Janelle Tucker ,\n17 hours ago The Anderson Street project is underway in Manchester. The project covers Anderson Street from East Main Street to Union Street. It’s a complete reconstruction consisting of sanitary sewer, water, storm sewer, sub-drain and a new concrete surface. The cost for the project totals one-point-one-four million dollars. Street Superintendent Jason... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
